msgid "An annotation can also get a question of its own: in review mode its text is replaced by that question, in bold, so there is something to answer; tap the row to swap question and text."
msgstr "标注还可以设置自己的问题：复习模式下整条文字会被替换成该问题（加粗显示），让人有内容可回想；点击该行可在问题与原文之间切换。"

msgid "A separate way of covering, more precise than the whole line. It has two modes, picked words and question; the list's “Custom” tab shows the annotations that have either."
msgstr "一种比整行遮盖更精细的遮盖方式，分两种模式：挖空和问答。列表中的“自定义”标签会显示设置了其中任意一种的标注。"

msgid "Picked words"
msgstr "挖空（选词）"

msgid "Open an annotation's card, delete everything that should stay readable and tap Add; in review mode only those words are covered, the rest of the line stays readable."
msgstr "打开标注的卡片，删掉需要保留阅读的部分再点“添加”；复习模式下只遮盖这些词，其余文字照常可读。"

msgid "Question"
msgstr "问答"

msgid "Open an annotation's card and add a question for it, with the annotation itself as the answer. In review mode its text is replaced by the question, in bold; tap the row to swap question and text."
msgstr "打开标注的卡片并为它添加一个问题，标注本身就是答案。复习模式下整条文字会被替换成该问题（加粗显示），点击该行可在问题与原文之间切换。"

